  "description": "The text 'the floor is jews' is superimposed on the ancient mosaic, creating an analogical mapping where the mosaic (a culturally significant visual entity) is being used to represent or symbolize the antisemitic stereotype that Jews control global systems. The juxtaposition implies that the mosaic, as a foundational or 'floor' element, is metaphorically 'Jewish' — a direct mapping of the hateful text onto the visual material to amplify its message.",
